From: BEL <bel@H100-VM1.mzqbi1zdpcje1jsioelsqu3tog.rx.internal.cloudapp.net>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 11:22:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] [feat](kt-kernel): python side of per-expert
 promote/evict + staging skip

Mirrors the edits that were being made directly in site-packages, which
'pip install .' silently reverted on the first rebuild. Also carries the
AVX2 packed RAWINT4 selection that had only ever existed in the installed
copy.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
